    "['lost-measure dual-ended [parameter1]', [{'para_map': [], 'trans_command': 'mpls oam loss measurement dual-ended', 'parent_command': [], 'root': 'mpls oam loss measurement dual-ended', 'source': 'llm', 'origin_reponse': '##\\nmpls oam loss measurement dual-ended\\n##\\n\\nExplanation:\\nThe Huawei command `lost-measure dual-ended enable` configures dual-ended loss measurement for MPLS-TP OAM (Operations, Administration, and Maintenance). The equivalent Cisco command is `mpls oam loss measurement dual-ended` which enables the same functionality - bidirectional loss measurement for MPLS-TP networks.\\n\\nBoth commands serve the same purpose of enabling two-way packet loss measurement between MPLS-TP endpoints.', 'trans_template': 'mpls oam loss measurement dual-ended'}]]": 1,
